    OPT_levelRoute = "Offer the levelling route",
    OPT_levelRoute_TIP = "Shows the entry \"Levelling route\" in the gear menu at the top right of the quest log (and, with ezMap, in the map button under \"Journey\"). With \"Compute the route automatically\" it is computed by itself, otherwise when you click \"Compute route\": from the quests in your log, their objectives in your zone and all turn-ins. Experience according to the quest log, places according to the game or to Questie when it runs (the option or the click count as asking for those places); none of it is saved. Off: no entry, nothing is computed.",
    OPT_routeAuto = "Compute the route automatically",
    OPT_routeAuto_TIP = "Computes the levelling route by itself: shortly after you log in and, as long as there is no route yet, as soon as there are quests in your log. After that the route moves on as usual and inserts new quests; it is computed again after you abandon a quest, change a setting, enter another zone and when you open the world map after moving a bit – the route then starts where you are now. During combat only afterwards and without a chat message – the menu shows \"Computed automatically …\". Not by itself for characters who gain no experience (maximum level, experience turned off at a trainer). It does not change the map pin, the arrow or the quest tracker; that stays with your click or the options. \"Discard route\" or \"Cancel\" pauses the automatic computing until you click \"Compute route\" again. Off: the first route only comes with a click; an existing one is still computed again by itself after you abandon a quest or change a setting (as before).",
    OPT_routeVendor = "Plan vendors along the way",
